<title>INDIA: Indian June 97 vehicle production falls.</title>
<headline>Indian June 97 vehicle production falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of vehicles in June 1997 fell 1.0 percent compared to same month in the previous year, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>AUTOMOBILE PRODUCTION &amp; SALES	  (number of units)</p>
<p>  Category			PRODUCTION</p>
<p>		  June 97  May 97  June 96  Apr-June 97 Apr-June 96</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	23,412  23,343  24,434    67,088	 67,880</p>
<p>   CARS/JEEPS  40,339  42,772  38,476    112,327	109,715</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS 249,165 237,246 254,160    703,752	722,479</p>
<p>					 SALES</p>
<p>		  June 97  May 97  June 96  Apr-June 97 Apr-June 96</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	21,524  19,847  23,859	55,760	 63,703</p>
<p>   CARS/JEEPS  40,476  42,322  38,620     112,044	107,836</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS 244,611 249,549  254,753    693,527	703,871</p>
<p>Source: Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers</p>
<p>--New Delhi Newsroom +91-11-301-2024</p>
</text>
